ocuments/Projects/BunkerGame/.opencode/overnight_world_v2/runs/world_v2_attempt_2_20260831_103137.jsonl\n/Users/Ori/Documents/Projects/BunkerGame/.opencode/overnight_world_v2/runs/world_v2_attempt_6_20260831_103217.jsonl\n/Users/Ori/Documents/Projects/BunkerGame/.opencode/overnight_world_v2/runs/world_v2_attempt_4_20260831_103157.jsonl\n/Users/Ori/Documents/Projects/BunkerGame/.opencode/overnight_world_v2/current_checkpoint.txt\n/Users/Ori/Documents/Projects/BunkerGame/.opencode/evidence/sourcemap.json\n/Users/Ori/Documents/Projects/BunkerGame/.opencode/evidence/BunkerGame.rbxl\n---\nname: bunkergame-native-asset-pipeline\ndescription: Use for BunkerGame requests to create, generate, build, place, vary, or rework visual Roblox assets such as trees, rocks, boulders, props, bunker pieces, vegetation, debris, furniture, machinery, and environmental art. Orchestrates Muse, Qwen, MiMo, Roblox Assistant native generation, BloxForge QA, Asset Library registration, Rojo persistence, and Studio verification.\n---\n\n# BunkerGame Native Asset Pipeline\n\nThis is the canonical production workflow for visual asset creation in BunkerGame.\n\nThe user gives a high-level request such as:\n\n- \"תעשה עצים אמיתיים\"\n- \"תפזר אבנים ברחבי המפה\"\n- \"תבנה שסתום חלוד\"\n- \"תעשה וריאציה של העץ הזה לביום אחר\"\n\nThe user must NOT need to manually coordinate agents.\n\n## Canonical ownership\n\n### Muse — Art Director\n\nMuse owns:\n\n- interpretation of the user's visual intent;\n- art direction;\n- deciding what Qwen must investigate;\n- delegating implementation to MiMo;\n- reviewing actual visual evidence after generation;\n- accepting, requesting revision, or rejecting the result.\n\nMuse must actually be invoked.\n\nA final Muse review MUST occur after visual evidence exists.\n\nDo not claim Muse participation without a real invocation/session.\n\n### Qwen — Reasoner + Refrencer\n\nUse `bunkergame-master-reasoner`.\n\nQwen owns:\n\n- reasoning about the requested asset;\n- proportions and silhouette;\n- material/surface language;\n- environment/context fit;\n- generation strategy;\n- reference strategy;\n- finding the closest approved Asset Library family before generating something new.\n\nQwen is NOT the mesh generator.\n\nQwen must not replace Roblox Assistant.\n\n## Reference priority\n\nBefore new generation, search the APPROVED Asset Library.\n\nReference priority:\n\n1. USER_REFERENCE\n2. LIBRARY_REFERENCE\n3. QWEN_GENERATED_REFERENCE\n4. ONLINE_REFERENCE\n5. text-only generation only when a reference is unnecessary or unavailable\n\nFor a visually important asset, prefer reference-driven native generation when it materially improves quality.\n\nQwen must output exactly one provenance classification:\n\n`QWEN_REFERENCE_SOURCE=USER_REFERENCE`\n`QWEN_REFERENCE_SOURCE=LIBRARY_REFERENCE`\n`QWEN_REFERENCE_SOURCE=QWEN_GENERATED_REFERENCE`\n`QWEN_REFERENCE_SOURCE=ONLINE_REFERENCE`\n`QWEN_REFERENCE_SOURCE=NONE`\n\n### Critical library rule\n\nDo NOT treat arbitrary Studio instances, archived content, `NOT IN USE WORLD`,\ntemporary meshes, rejected assets, test assets, or unregistered generated\ncontent as approved Asset Library assets.\n\nOnly an asset explicitly registered in the canonical approved Asset Library\ncounts as `LIBRARY_REFERENCE`.\n\nIf a close approved family exists, use it as the base/reference for the new\nvariant instead of regenerating the concept from scratch.\n\n## MiMo — Execution Orchestrator\n\nUse `bunker-builder`.\n\nMiMo owns execution/tool orchestration.\n\nMiMo should receive:\n\n- Muse art direction;\n- Qwen reasoning;\n- Qwen reference/provenance;\n","metadata":{"output":"/Users/Ori/Documents/Projects/BunkerGame/.opencode/synthetic-sol-v2/MASTER_PROMPT.md\n/Users/Ori/Documents/Projects/BunkerGame/.opencode/agents/bunkergame-art-director.md\n/Users/Ori/Documents/Projects/BunkerGame/.opencode/agents/bunker-builder.md\n/Users/Ori/Documents/Projects/BunkerGame/.opencode/skills/bunkergame-native-asset-pipeline/SKILL.md\ntotal 0\ndrwxr-xr-x   3 Ori  staff   96 Aug 30 22:35 .\ndrwxr-xr-x  14 Ori  staff  448 Aug 31 10:27 ..\ndrwxr-xr-x   3 Ori  staff   96 Aug 30 22:35 bunkergame-native-asset-pipeline\n/Users/Ori/Documents/Projects/BunkerGame/.opencode/overnight_world_v2/raw_monitor.sh\n/Users/Ori/Documents/Projects/BunkerGame/.opencode/overnight_world_v2/last_run_exit.txt\n/Users/Ori/Documents/Projects/BunkerGame/.opencode/overnight_world_v2/monitor.py\n/Users/Ori/Documents/Projects/BunkerGame/.opencode/overnight_world_v2/evidence/opencode_health.json\n/Users/Ori/Documents/Projects/BunkerGame/.opencode/overnight_world_v2/evidence/mcp_latest.txt\n/Users/Ori/Documents/Projects/BunkerGame/.opencode/overnight_world_v2/current_run_file.txt\n/Users/Ori/Documents/Projects/BunkerGame/.opencode/overnight_world_v2/current_activity.txt\n/Users/Ori/Documents/Projects/BunkerGame/.opencode/overnight_world_v2/watchdog.sh.pre_mcp_fix\n/Users/Ori/Documents/Projects/BunkerGame/.opencode/overnight_world_v2/failed_cli_attempts_20260831_103517/world_v2_attempt_3_20260831_103147.jsonl\n/Users/Ori/Documents/Projects/BunkerGame/.opencode/overnight_world_v2/failed_cli_attempts_20260831_103517/world_v2_attempt_1_20260831_103126.jsonl\n/Users/Ori/Documents/Projects/BunkerGame/.opencode/overnight_world_v2/failed_cli_attempts_20260831_103517/world_v2_attempt_5_20260831_103207.jsonl\n/Users/Ori/Documents/Projects/BunkerGame/.opencode/overnight_world_v2/failed_cli_attempts_20260831_103517/world_v2_attempt_2_20260831_103137.jsonl\n/Users/Ori/Documents/Projects/BunkerGame/.opencode/overnight_world_v2/failed_cli_attempts_20260831_103517/world_v2_attempt_6_20260831_103217.jsonl\n/Users/Ori/Documents/Projects/BunkerGame/.opencode/overnight_world_v2/failed_cli_attempts_20260831_103517/world_v2_attempt_4_20260831_103157.jsonl\n/Users/Ori/Documents/Projects/BunkerGame/.opencode/overnight_world_v2/watchdog.pid\n/Users/Ori/Documents/Projects/BunkerGame/.opencode/overnight_world_v2/watchdog_before_resume_20260831_103124.