08_PRESENTATION\nCP09_TECH_QA\nCP10_PLAY_QA\nCP11_VISUAL_QA\nCP12_FINAL\n\n============================================================\nCP01_SAFETY\n============================================================\n\nStart with:\n\n.opencode/overnight_world_v2/checkpoint.sh CP01_SAFETY START \"Inspecting existing world and preserving safety boundary\"\n\nInspect:\n\n- current filesystem;\n- current Studio;\n- current world hierarchy;\n- approved GeneratedAssets;\n- Asset Library;\n- existing spawn;\n- terrain;\n- existing gameplay-critical anchors;\n- existing trees;\n- existing rocks;\n- bunker/facility;\n- current Studio mode.\n\nDo not delete anything.\n\nConfirm Studio is Edit mode before implementation.\n\nCreate a baseline understanding of what already exists and what can be reused.\n\nPASS only when the implementation boundary is understood.\n\n============================================================\nCP02_WORLD_PLAN\n============================================================\n\nInvoke the real Qwen master-reasoner.\n\nQwen must reason about:\n\nzsh:9: no such file or directory: /usr/local/bin/bloxforge\n","exit":0,"truncated":false},"title":"cat /Users/Ori/Documents/Projects/BunkerGame/.opencode/overnight_world_v2/state.txt\ncat /Users/Ori/Documents/Projects/BunkerGame/.opencode/overnight_world_v2/current_run_file.txt 2>&1\ncat /Users/Ori/Documents/Projects/BunkerGame/.opencode/overnight_world_v2/attempt.txt 2>&1\necho \"--- studio health ---\"\ncat /Users/Ori/Documents/Projects/BunkerGame/.opencode/overnight_world_v2/evidence/opencode_health.json 2>&1 | head -n 100\necho \"--- directive ---\"\ncat /Users/Ori/Documents/Projects/BunkerGame/.opencode/overnight_world_v2/directive.txt 2>&1 | head -n 200\n# Inspect Roblox Studio via bloxforge\n/usr/local/bin/bloxforge --help 2>&1 | head -n 30\n","time":{"start":1788165145775,"end":1788165145782}},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"fc_01a056f2c0807a639f0a1bbb45ae7abb"}},"id":"prt_056f2c3ff00112prXe1U1QEE3l","sessi