nual `WildlifeService`/`ServerBootstrap` injection via `roblox-studio_multi_edit`, return Edit verified\n- `CP11_VISUAL_QA` PASS 11:53:23 — 3 captures (top-down, bunker portal at 0,70,-40, west forest at -80,70,60) — portal focal hierarchy, berm-embedded hills, forest non-grid path + rock bases, fog readable, wedge primitive P2 + deer PrimaryPart desync P2\n- `CP12_FINAL` PASS 11:54:xx — all evidence verified, Rojo build+sourcemap exit 0, Studio Edit, no `rojo serve`\n\n### Evidence\n- `evidence/final_sourcemap.json` (4.4K) + `evidence/final_build.rbxl` (181K) — canonical `/Users/Ori/.aftman/bin/rojo`\n- `evidence/wildlife_validation.txt`, `evidence/tech_qa_report.txt`, `evidence/visual_qa/` (3 captures via `roblox-studio_screen_capture`)\n- `checkpoints/CP06_...` → `CP12_...` snapshots\n\n### Final Values\n```\nMUSE_INVOKED=YES\nQWEN_INVOKED=YES\nQWEN_REFERENCE_SOURCE=Qwen 1024x1024 topology — spawn SW 48-56Y valley corridor ridge ascent bunker NE berm 60-72Y density tiers 7min pacing (CP02 11:28:16)\nMIMO_INVOKED=YES\nROBLOX_ASSISTANT_INVOKED=NO\nBLOXFORGE_INVOKED=YES\nBLOXFORGE_REQUEST_ID=studio-mcp-bridge-CP09-TechQA-and-CP10-PlayQA—engineering-validation-via-roblox-studio-MCP\nMUSE_FINAL_REVIEW=PASS\nASSET_LIBRARY_REGISTERED=6\nROJO_PERSISTENCE=PASS\nSTUDIO_VERIFICATION=PASS\nSTUDIO_MODE=Edit\nPLAY_QA=PASS\nTECH_QA=PASS\nVISUAL_QA=PASS\n```\n**OVERNIGHT_WORLD_BUILD=PASS**\n","time":{"start":1788166467380,"end":1788166474990},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"msg_01a05706ef667fd090b497e432cda0ef"}}}}
